$ mwf hook stop --host pi
< {"cwd":"[ROOT]","session_id":"p1","prompt_id":"a.b-1","stop_hook_active":false}
{"hookSpecificOutput":{"additionalContext":"mwf: before you finish, check whether this turn taught something worth keeping in the project wiki: a preference of the user, a decision and its reasons, a pitfall and its fix, how something in this project works, or work in progress to hand off. If it did, run `mwf search <words>` first; prefer `mwf patch` on a page that already covers it, otherwise `mwf new` with a clear summary, and add links in both directions to the related pages mwf lists after the write. If nothing is worth keeping, do nothing and finish.","hookEventName":"Stop"}}

